    "key": "phq9.p006",
    "en": "Hub",
    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p007",
    "en": "Following one person over time",
    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p008",
    "en": "This measure exists to answer one question the 14 September briefing asked: does a person move from acute distress towards a clinical disorder, or away from it? It is for repeating with <b>someone already in care</b>, so the second score can be compared with the first.",
    "html": true,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p009",
    "en": "Who, and which visit",
    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p010",
    "en": "Organisation",
    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p011",
    "en": "Administered by",
    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p012",
    "en": "A measure like this belongs with a counsellor or clinician, not a volunteer.",
    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p013",
    "en": "Date — Gregorian (AD)",
    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p014",
    "en": "Contact code",
    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p015",
    "en": "Paste the code from the person's <a href=\"contact.html\">service contact record</a>, so the two scores can be lined up without a name.",
    "html": true,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
