    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p038",
    "en": "Item-by-item answers are kept because a total alone cannot be re-checked, and because item 9 has to be auditable. There is no name, no phone number and no date of birth.",
    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p039",
    "en": "Attribution",
    "html": false,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "phq9.p040",
    "en": "PHQ-9 was developed by Drs Robert L. Spitzer, Janet B.W. Williams, Kurt Kroenke and colleagues, with an educational grant from Pfizer Inc. The instrument carries the statement: <i>“No permission required to reproduce, translate, display or distribute.”</i> The items above are reproduced verbatim on that basis. The Nepali adaptation was made and validated through the Programme for Improving Mental Health Care (PRIME) consortium, funded by UK aid — and is <b>not</b> included here, for the reason given at the top of this page.",
    "html": true,
    "page": "phq9.html"
  },
