  {
    "key": "ref.p008",
    "en": "On 14 September the briefing recorded that around 5,000 psychosocial counselling cases had been logged, but that once a person reaches a health facility their case goes into HMIS and is no longer visible here. This form is the join. Without it, “continuum of care” is a claim rather than something anyone can show.",
