  {
    "key": "ref.p057",
    "en": "<b>This is the field that will be empty, and that is the finding.</b> A referral is only complete when the receiving service confirms the person arrived. Nobody can fill this in from the referring side alone. Leave it as “not yet known” and come back — the proportion that stays unknown is the honest measure of whether the pathway works.",
