    "page": "contact.html"
  },
  {
    "key": "svc.p033",
    "en": "Recorded to three decimal places — a grid of roughly 100 m. Enough to put the site on a map; not enough to point at a household. A precise pin, a small count and a target group together identify people even with no name attached, which is why the precision is reduced here rather than in the dashboard.",
