  {
    "key": "svc.p055",
    "en": "This is the only part that is saved. It is a <b>pseudonym, not an anonymous token</b>: the four inputs vary little, so someone holding a list of candidate names could test them against a code. Adequate for agreeing these questions; a live register needs the code mixed with a secret this handset never holds, which means a server.",
